T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Criteria for Front View Selection:) Tj
T*
(   The Front View is the primary anchor of the entire orthographic projection drawing. The) Tj
T*
(   following engineering rules govern its selection:) Tj
