T*
(   orientation or geometry.) Tj
T*
(   - Command Sequence:) Tj
T*
(   * Command: MOVE [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   * Select objects: Use Window, Crossing, or click individual entities -> [Enter].) Tj
T*
