(   - Command Sequence:) Tj
T*
(   * Command: COPY [Enter] -> Select objects -> [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   * Specify base point -> Specify second point of displacement.) Tj
T*
(   * Default Behavior: Multiple copy mode is active by default; the user can continue clicking) Tj
T*
(   second points indefinitely to paste multiple instances until pressing Enter or Esc.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. The Array Sub-Option in COPY:) Tj
T*
