T*
(   * Moving cursor and typing distance '30' places 5 copies spaced 30 mm apart along the vector.) Tj
T*
(   * Typing 'F' \(Fit\) specifies the total overall distance over which all 5 items are spaced) Tj
T*
(   equally!) Tj
