T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. FILLET Command \(F\):) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Connects two non-parallel lines or curved entities with an arc of specified radius) Tj
T*
(   R that is smoothly tangent to both entities.) Tj
T*
(   - Execution Sequence:) Tj
T*
(   * Command: FILLET [Enter]) Tj
T*
(   * Type 'R' -> Enter radius value \(e.g. 15 mm\) [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   * Select first object -> Select second object.) Tj
T*
(   - Zero-Radius Cleanup \(R = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   * Setting Radius = 0 and selecting two non-intersecting or crossed lines automatically trims or) Tj
T*
(   extends them to a crisp, sharp 90? or acute corner vertex! \(Fastest line cleanup tool in CAD\).) Tj
T*
