(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the selection set modes in AutoCAD: Window, Crossing, Fence, Window Polygon \(WP\), Crossing Polygon \(CP\), and Previous \(P\), with specific drafting scenarios for each.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Comprehensive Selection Set Modes:) Tj
T*
(   - Window \(W\):) Tj
T*
(   * Click left, move right \(Blue box\). Selects ONLY entities completely contained inside the) Tj
T*
(   rectangular box.) Tj
T*
(   * Scenario: Isolating a small circular hole and its centerlines located inside a large outer) Tj
T*
(   plate without selecting the plate outline.) Tj
T*
(   - Crossing \(C\):) Tj
T*
(   * Click right, move left \(Green box\). Selects all entities completely inside OR touched/crossed) Tj
T*
(   by the dashed boundary.) Tj
T*
(   * Scenario: Quick mass selection of an entire view including surrounding dimensions for) Tj
T*
(   deletion or translation.) Tj
T*
(   - Fence \(F\):) Tj
T*
(   * Type 'F' [Enter] at select prompt. Prompts user to click a continuous multi-segment path. All) Tj
T*
(   entities intersecting the fence are selected.) Tj
T*
(   * Scenario: Trimming 20 parallel projection lines passing across a reference axis in a single) Tj
T*
(   stroke.) Tj
T*
(   - Window Polygon \(WP\):) Tj
T*
(   * Type 'WP' [Enter]. Prompts user to click irregular polygonal vertices. Selects entities) Tj
T*
(   completely enclosed inside the custom polygon.) Tj
T*
(   * Scenario: Selecting machine components arranged along an inclined angle without grabbing) Tj
T*
(   adjacent orthogonal views.) Tj
T*
(   - Crossing Polygon \(CP\):) Tj
T*
(   * Type 'CP' [Enter]. Irregular polygon that selects entities enclosed or crossed.) Tj
T*
(   - Previous \(P\):) Tj
T*
(   * Type 'P' [Enter]. Instantly re-selects the exact set of objects selected in the prior) Tj
T*
(   command.) Tj
T*
(   * Scenario: If you just MOVED a group of 15 entities and now want to ROTATE the exact same) Tj
T*
(   group, typing 'P' eliminates re-selecting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
