(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the procedure to dimension orthographic multi-view drawings in AutoCAD according to ISO standards, detailing baseline vs continuous dimensioning.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. ISO Standard Rules for Multi-View Dimensioning:) Tj
T*
(   - Rule of Placement: Dimensions should be placed outside the views between the Front View and) Tj
T*
(   Top View, or between Front View and Side View, rather than scattered haphazardly around the) Tj
T*
