T*
(   3. RAY Command:) Tj
T*
(   - Function: Creates a semi-infinite line originating at a picked start point and extending) Tj
T*
(   infinitely in one specified direction.) Tj
T*
(   - Application: Projecting depth from Top View to miter line without cluttering upper quadrants.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Layer Isolation Best Practice:) Tj
T*
(   - Place all Xlines and Rays on a dedicated layer named 'CONSTRUCT' or 'DEFPOINTS' and toggle) Tj
T*
