12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Summarize the complete engineering quality audit checklist for validating orthographic multi-view drawings prior to manufacturing release.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Engineering Quality Audit Protocol for Orthographic Drawings:) Tj
T*
(   1. Projection Alignment & Correspondence Check:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that Front View and Top View are strictly vertically aligned \(common width X\).) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that Front View and Side Views are strictly horizontally aligned \(common height Z\).) Tj
T*
(   - Verify depth consistency between Top and Side views via 45? miter line check.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Line Standards & Linetype Verification:) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm visible outlines are on 'VISIBLE' layer with 0.5 mm lineweight.) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm hidden lines are on 'HIDDEN' layer with 0.25 mm lineweight; check that dashes touch) Tj
T*
ET

